$(Section 'Filter pad expertise' 'Depth filtration is more than a nominal retention number' '<div class="prose-grid"><div><p>Industrial filter pads use a porous fibre matrix to capture particles throughout the thickness of the media. This depth-loading behaviour can provide useful contaminant-holding capacity and stable clarification where a thin surface screen would blind rapidly.</p><p>For a reliable recommendation, engineers must consider fibre composition, thickness, basis weight (GSM), porosity, wet and dry strength, flow behaviour, particle-retention objective and compatibility with the process fluid. Sri Bharathi supplies pulp pads, sparkler-format pads, activated carbon pads and high-temperature media, with customised dimensions available subject to application review.</p><p><a href="filter-pads/index.html">Use our filter-pad selection guide</a></p></div><aside class="note"><strong>Specify the duty, not only the pad.</strong><p>Send a retained sample, current media details or clarity objective when possible. Trial data under representative temperature, pressure and solids load is the best basis for final selection.</p></aside></div>' 'section-muted')
$(Section 'Industries served' 'Filtration support from clarification to final polishing' (Cards -Items @(
@('A','Pharmaceutical processing','Pre-filtration, clarification and particulate-control duties where documented media selection is essential.','<a href="applications/pharmaceutical-filtration.html">Pharmaceutical filtration →</a>'),
@('B','Chemicals','Media chosen around chemical compatibility, viscosity, temperature, solids loading and downstream requirements.','<a href="applications/chemical-filtration.html">Chemical filtration →</a>'),
@('C','Food & beverage','Clarification media for compatible beverages and food-process liquids, with application-specific quality documentation.','<a href="applications/food-beverage-filtration.html">Food & beverage filtration →</a>'),
@('D','Edible oils','Particulate removal in cooking-oil and process-oil duties, including verified high-temperature pad options.','<a href="applications/edible-oil-filtration.html">Edible-oil filtration →</a>'),
@('E','Gelatin','Cellulose depth media and cartridges considered as staged clarification components in gelatin processing.','<a href="applications/gelatin-filtration.html">Gelatin filtration →</a>'),
@('F','Water & utilities','Cartridge pre-filtration and general particulate-removal duties for compatible process-water systems.','<a href="filter-cartridges/index.html">Cartridge options →</a>')
)))
$(Section 'Quality by control' 'Relevant parameters are verified against the intended use' '<div class="prose"><p>Published Sri Bharathi manufacturing information describes monitored raw materials, automated pad production and routine checks of filtration efficiency, porosity, absorbency, filtration speed and bursting factor. Wet-strength treatment is used on relevant paper and pad grades. Final acceptance criteria should be agreed for each application.</p><p>The legacy website references ISO 9001:2000 and Dun &amp; Bradstreet certification. Because current certificate files and validity dates were not publicly available during this rebuild, this website does not present those as current approvals. <a href="about/certifications.html">Read the certification-document policy</a>.</p></div>' 'section-muted')
$(Section 'Technical resources' 'Short guides for better filtration decisions' (Cards -Items @(
